# @hub-lanes
# Main-red breaker (BH-8706): while flags/main-red-<owner>-<repo> is up, put
# merge-queue-paused on every queued PR of that repo (Mergify's non-hotfix
# rules exclude it), file one ai-build + hotfix ticket per red episode, and
# remove the label once main is green. Ledger kinds main_red_breaker and
# main_red_hotfix. WRITES: logs/main-red-breaker.log, state/main-red-breaker/.
# Off: flags/lane-off-main-red-breaker.
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/main-red-breaker.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
